    "updated_at": "2019-09-12T14:22:52Z",
    "body": "Yeah, or at least mention that user agents should ensure that this API returns consistent results if they offer some kind of user profiles (including private profiles) as otherwise they can be distinguished. And to add, not just the API, but also the behavior on disk as otherwise you can still get there using \"brute force\".",
